      },
      {
        "id": "nd_GD6GD3HPPF5MEB1KTVJAXCW3HJ",
        "kind": "text-gen",
        "position": {
          "x": 1050,
          "y": 700
        },
        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for an ASMR product video about cooking basics.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with an overcast soft dome with no directional shadow at all and grade to a Portra-style palette with creamy skin tones and soft greens.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
